      "floor": 19,
      "textRawHtml": "google play store 最方便<br /><br />1. 切换 Google Play 到美区（挂美区代理）<br />Google Play → Settings → General → Account and device preferences → Country and profiles → United States ，如果不行的话大概率加了一些 family 退出就行还有已有账号余额消耗光<br />2. 创建美国 Google Payments 付款资料，浏览器打开 <a href=\"http://payments.google.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">payments.google.com</a> → Settings → Payments profile → Country/Region → Create new profile → United States ，实际测试建议找个 aws ，microsoft 在某个州的公司地址电话填上<br />3. google play store 绑定招商银行 Visa 双币卡或者运通",
      "textZhHtml": "google play store 最方便<br><br>1. 切换 Google Play 到美区（挂美区代理）<br>Google Play → Settings → General → Account and device preferences → Country and profiles → United States ，如果不行的话大概率加了一些 family 退出就行还有已有账号余额消耗光<br>2. 创建美国 Google Payments 付款资料，浏览器打开 <a href=\"http://payments.google.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">payments.google.com</a> → Settings → Payments profile → Country/Region → Create new profile → United States ，实际测试建议找个 aws ，microsoft 在某个州的公司地址电话填上<br>3. google play store 绑定招商银行 Visa 双币卡或者运通",
